K9s Web UI
Copyright 2026 K9s Web UI contributors

Independent Kubernetes dashboard; not an official derailed/k9s project.
The repository contains the dashboard frontend, Go HTTP API, NVIDIA DCGM
collector, launcher and installer source. It does not contain the original
private k9s-ui executable, upstream k9s or kubectl binaries.

Go builds include the Go runtime and standard library. Their license and
patent grant are reproduced under licenses/. The build uses no third-party
Go modules. Frontend runtime assets are served locally without external fonts.
Development-only npm dependencies retain their own licenses and are not
included by the package script.

Optional kubectl downloads are obtained from the official Kubernetes release
host and checked against its published SHA-256. Kubernetes source and license:
https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes
